  "summary": {
    "text": "GPT-5.6 Terra is the middle tier of OpenAI's GPT-5.6 family, a reasoning language model for text and image input that OpenAI describes as a capable lower-cost option. Released on 9 July 2026 in ChatGPT, Codex, the API and Amazon Bedrock, it roughly corresponds to the mini tier of earlier GPT-5 families, according to the API docs.",
