  "notes": "Middle tier of the GPT-5.6 family (system card: a capable lower-cost option). The deprecations page names gpt-5.6-terra as the replacement for gpt-5-mini-2025-08-07 and several older small models. In Codex, a notice of 2026-07-31 named gpt-5.6-terra as the replacement for gpt-5.4 (not gpt-5.4-mini, which went to gpt-5.6-luna) ahead of their retirement from Codex with ChatGPT sign-in on 2026-08-31; the relation follows the API docs tier mapping instead. On 2026-07-30 its API price was cut by 20%. The openai.com posts were read through Wayback Machine captures."
